//! lanes keep their code). 5 rules (`packed-code-cpasync-stage-per-use-prmt-
//! decode` A +1 -- the B883 rung-5 GOAT; `ldmatrix-byte-subword-granularity-
//! limit` A +1 -- B883's structural note + B880's positive-rule boundary;
//! `transposed-smem-stage-repairs-strided-epilogue` A +1 -- the B884 rung-6
//! GOAT; `per-block-scalar-slab-cpasync-stage` A +1 -- the B884 honest-cap
